"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"A \"calendar\" user should be set on FSM Team. Events will be added to his\n"
"calendar. Then the FSM Order' person_id (worker) will be an attendee of\n"
"the calendar's event (Meeting).\n"
"\n"
